This directory is an independent clean-room toy inspired by ideas from
"world2vec: Mechanistic world models through latent dynamics learning"
(Schmidt, Gonzalez Laiz, Szuppinger, Schneider, arXiv:2610.40637). Official
code at dynamical-inference/world2vec is not released / not vendored; no text,
figures, or code from the paper or upstream repo are copied here. See NOTICE.

